
== the discovery stand-in
3 pairs
[/mnt/files] [/run/tsync/tsync-files.sock]
[/mnt/files/media] [/run/tsync/tsync-media.sock]
[/mnt/spaced name] [/run/tsync/tsync-spaced name.sock]

== resolution
/mnt/files/a/b.txt -> /mnt/files, rel "a/b.txt", name "b.txt", socket /run/tsync/tsync-files.sock
/mnt/files -> /mnt/files, rel "", name "The folder", socket /run/tsync/tsync-files.sock
/mnt/files/ -> /mnt/files, rel "", name "The folder", socket /run/tsync/tsync-files.sock
/mnt/files/media/x.mkv -> /mnt/files/media, rel "x.mkv", name "x.mkv", socket /run/tsync/tsync-media.sock
/mnt/files-elsewhere/x -> no mount
/home/someone/x -> no mount
/home/someone/shortcut/deep/c.txt -> /mnt/files, rel "a/deep/c.txt", name "c.txt", socket /run/tsync/tsync-files.sock
/home/someone/relative/y.mkv -> /mnt/files/media, rel "y.mkv", name "y.mkv", socket /run/tsync/tsync-media.sock
/mnt/spaced name/z -> /mnt/spaced name, rel "z", name "z", socket /run/tsync/tsync-spaced name.sock
/mnt/files/./a//../b -> /mnt/files, rel "b", name "b", socket /run/tsync/tsync-files.sock
/home/loop/x -> no mount
with no mounts: no mount, 0 questions asked
questions asked at or below a mount point: 0

== menu
file, online-only: Copy Share Link (tsync), Make Available Offline (cloud-download)
file, cached: Copy Share Link (tsync), Make Available Offline (cloud-download), Make Online Only (cloud-upload)
file, pinned: Copy Share Link (tsync), Keep Offline Longer (cloud-download), Make Online Only (cloud-upload)
directory: Copy Share Link (tsync), Make Available Offline (cloud-download), Make Online Only (cloud-upload)
symlink: Copy Share Link (tsync)
not_found: nothing
no answer: Copy Share Link (tsync)

== stat while the menu is built
a row: Copy Share Link (tsync), Make Available Offline (cloud-download), Make Online Only (cloud-upload)
refused not_found: nothing
another refusal: Copy Share Link (tsync)
a reply that is not an object: Copy Share Link (tsync)
the first request: {"action":"stat","rel":"a/b.txt"}
an owner that is silent: Copy Share Link (tsync); ended by its deadline: yes
an owner that is trickle: Copy Share Link (tsync); ended by its deadline: yes
an owner that is absent: Copy Share Link (tsync); ended by its deadline: yes

== requests
{"action":"share","rel":"sub dir/a b.txt"}
{"action":"restore","rel":"sub dir/a b.txt"}
{"action":"evict","rel":"sub dir/a b.txt"}
{"action":"share","rel":""}

